и </span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif'; mso-ansi-language: TG;\\\">ғ</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif';\\\">айриман</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif'; mso-ansi-language: TG;\\\">қ</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif';\\\">ул;</span></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 18.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 10.8pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif';\\\">-Замонати шахсони во</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif'; mso-ansi-language: TG;\\\">қ</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif';\\\">еию </span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif'; mso-ansi-language: TG;\\\">ҳ</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif';\\\">у</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif'; mso-ansi-language: TG;\\\">қ</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif';\\\">у</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif'; mso-ansi-language: TG;\\\">қӣ</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif';\\\">;</span></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 18.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 10.55pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif';\\\">-Молу мулки ман</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif'; mso-ansi-language: TG;\\\">қ</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif';\\\">ул;</span></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 17.05pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 10.55pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif'; mso-ansi-language: TG;\\\">-Ҷа</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif';\\\">во</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif'; mso-ansi-language: TG;\\\">ҳ</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif';\\\">ирот;</span></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 17.05pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 10.55pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif'; mso-ansi-language: TG;\\\">-Амонату п</span></span><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif';\\\">асандоз;</span></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 17.05pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 10.55pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span class=\\\"2\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Microsoft Sans Serif'; mso-ansi-language: TG;\\\">-Дигар гаравҳои бозоргир;</span></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13pt;\\\">-Гарави омехта.<br><br></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Барои гирифтани маълумоти муфассал ба рақамҳои маркази тамоси бонк <strong>8855</strong> занг занед.</span></p>\",\"entity\":\"legal_entity\",\"min_amount\":1000.0,\"max_amount\":15000000.0,\"percent\":16.0,\"month\":60,\"annual_rate\":\"Фоизи солона\",\"annual_rate_subtitle\":\"16%\",\"get_credit\":\"Маблағи ниҳоӣ\",\"get_credit_subtitle\":\"бемаҳдуд\",\"max_term\":\"Муҳлати қарз\",\"max_term_subtitle\":\"то 60 моҳ\",\"recommended\":false,\"recommended_image\":null,\"status\":1,\"language_id\":1,\"container_id\":95499},{\"id\":52,\"image\":\"https://webapi.ssb.tj/media/%D0%90%D0%B2%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B8%D0%BB_iKF52rE.png\",\"cover\":\"https://webapi.ssb.tj/media/%D0%90%D0%B2%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B8%D0%BB_g4BXmse.png\",\"title\":\"Қарз барои харидории Автомобил\",\"description\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Қарз барои харидани&nbsp; ҳама намуди воситаҳои нақлиёт пешниҳод карда мешавад.</span></p>\\r\\n<hr>\\r\\n<p><br><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><strong>Шартҳои маҳсулоти қарзӣ<br><br></strong></span><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><strong><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">Талабот ба қарзгиранда:</span></strong><br><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">1.Шахсони воқеӣ (шаҳрванди Ҷумҳурии Тоҷикистон, ки ба синни 21 сола расидааст);</span><br><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">2.Қарзгир бояд на кам аз 3 сол таҷрибаи идоракунии воситаи нақлиёт дошта бошад;</span></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">3.Шахсони ҳуқуқӣ(фаъолияти кории на кам аз 1 сола дошта бошад)</span></span></p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify;\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><strong>Таъминот:</strong><br></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraph\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 8.75pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -10.9pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Times New Roman, serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.6667px;\\\">1.Воситаи нақлиёти аз ҳисоби қарз харидоришаванда;<br></span></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraph\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 8.75pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -10.9pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Times New Roman, serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.6667px;\\\">2. Молу мулки ғайриманқул;</span></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraph\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 8.75pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -10.9pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Times New Roman, serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.6667px;\\\">3. Ҷавоҳирот;</span></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraph\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 8.75pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -10.9pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Times New Roman, serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.6667px;\\\">4. Маблағи амаонат ва/ ё пасандоз.</span></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoListParagraph\\\" style=\\\"margin-left: 8.75pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -10.9pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><strong><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%;\\\">Рӯихати ҳуҷҷатҳои пешниҳодшаванда<br><br></span></strong></span></p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\"><strong style=\\\"font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">Барои шахсони воқеӣ:<br></span></span></strong><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 107%;\\\">1.Дархост барои гирифтани қарз;<br></span><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 107%;\\\">2.Шиносномаи муштарӣ бо қайди ҷои истиқомат ва РМА;<br></span><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 107%;\\\">3.Сурати муштарӣ бо андозаи 4х6;<br></span><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 107%;\\\">4.Патент ё шаҳодатнома, инчунин дигар ҳуҷҷатҳои тасдиқкунандаи фаъолият ҳангоми барои фаъолияти соҳибкорӣ истифода намудани нақлиёти харидоришаванда;<br></span><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 107%;\\\">5.Маълумотномаи музди меҳнат ва/ё дигар ҳуҷҷати тасдикунандаи манбаи даромад барои 6 (шаш) моҳи охир (ё дигар ҳуҷҷати тасдиқкунандаи музди меҳнати қарзгиранда).<br><br></span></span><strong style=\\\"font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">Барои шахсони ҳуқуқӣ:<br></span></span></strong><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 17.12px;\\\">1.<span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 107%;\\\">Дархост барои гирифтани қарз;</span><br></span><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 17.12px;\\\">2.<span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 107%;\\\">Ҳуҷҷатҳои таъсисии шахси ҳуқуқӣ</span>;<br></span><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 17.12px;\\\">3.<span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 107%;\\\">Нусхаи бо муҳр тасдиқшудаи фармони (қарори) таъин шудани роҳбар ва сармуҳосиби шахси ҳуқуқӣ</span>;<br></span><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 17.12px;\\\">4.<span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 107%;\\\">Қарори мақоми салоҳиятдори шахси ҳуқуқӣ барои гирифтани қарз ва пешниҳоди гарав</span>;<br></span><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 17.12px;\\\">5.</span><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 107%;\\\">Шиносномаи роҳбар ва сармуҳосиби шахси ҳуқуқӣ бо қайди ҷои истиқомат;</span></span></span></p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 107%;\\\">6.</span>Маълумотнома аз нозироти андоз оиди набудани қарздори дар назди буҷет;<br>7.Ҳуҷҷатҳои молиявӣ бо қайди мақомоти андоз;<br>8.Нақшаи тиҷоратӣ (дар шакли озод) ё нақшаи тиҷоратӣ- пурсишнома дар шакли тасдиқшуда;<br><span lang=\\\"TG\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 107%;\\\">9.Варақаи намунаи имзо